Print masters. These come from the artwork producer, not from this repo, and are
CMYK or spot — not the RGB hexes the SVG check validates.

  ga-logo-cmyk.eps   ga-logo-cmyk.pdf
  ga-logo-navy.eps   ga-logo-black.eps
  ga-logo-1c.eps     single-colour master for engraving and embroidery

Brand CMYK builds and their FOGRA39L round-trip deltas live in tokens.json under
"brand". Do not re-separate RGB artwork to CMYK by eye.
